[gd_scene format=3]

; The Ossuary, east of the Undercroft (map offset (292.5, -8.5)): where the dead machines are kept like relics,
; racked in rows down a sunken nave. Steps lead down to a dais at the far end where the Harpoon relic rests in
; a shaft of light. Taking it teaches it at once: a mooring ring over the dais, and a second one higher up,
; pull the pilgrim onto a gallery (an optional ledge with glyphs) that runs back west over the steps.
; A dead end: the way out is the west doorway.

